 "limitations": [
  "DRC now checks the copper as saved and plotted (revisions 11-26 refilled the zones first). KiCad reports at most 199 items of one type, so truncated silkscreen types are compared by count only. Other recorded DRC warnings (dangling track stubs carried from the Eagle source) and schematic-parity warnings are unchanged.",
